  emits this same index plus one extra <sitemap> entry per public-profile
  shard (see artifacts/api-server/src/routes/sitemap.ts). This static copy is
  the fallback so the root URL never resolves to SPA HTML if the function
  cold-starts or fails.

  KEEP THIS LIST IDENTICAL TO `SEGMENTS` IN sitemap.ts. The seoContract test
  fails the build if they drift.

  Canonical host is focusarx.site — the previous file and the API
  disagreed on host, which made every URL a cross-host duplicate.
-->
